     "l": 3,
     "text": "Fine Lines & Aging",
     "html": "Fine Lines &amp; Aging"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "As we age, our skin undergoes significant structural and functional changes which leave us with reduced levels of collagen, elastin, and oil production. These changes, coupled with other age-related factors such as genetics, sun exposure, lifestyle choices, and hormonal shifts, can lead to fine lines and wrinkles, as well as noticeable volume loss over time. To help target this skin concern, the following treatments and products might be right for you."
    },
