     "text": "Dry/Dehydrated",
     "html": "Dry/Dehydrated"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "In our dry Calgary climate, dehydrated skin is a concern that we are all familiar with. Common signs are dull, tight and/or cracking skin, along with possible discomfort like sensitivity or redness. In some cases, dry skin might be associated with other skin concerns such as eczema, psoriasis and dermatitis. A combination of internal and external causes can perpetuate the severity, including incorrect product use, climate and diet. To help address this skin concern, the following treatments and products might be right for you."
    },
